(4724604, 681633, 64929, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell...is that a whale coming up to the side of the boat??  If so, COOL!  I would have liked to see this shot from more of a distance, tho.</td>', 'Hard to tell...is that a whale coming up to the side of the boat??  If so, COOL!  I would have liked to see this shot from more of a distance, tho.', '2008-05-26 10:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
