(4726507, 682044, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wow, lots of potential in this shot.  Dead center horizon does not work for me here.  Maybe crop the bottem third to emphasze the trees.  Or crop the top third and empasize the reflection.</td>', 'Wow, lots of potential in this shot.  Dead center horizon does not work for me here.  Maybe crop the bottem third to emphasze the trees.  Or crop the top third and empasize the reflection.', '2008-05-26 23:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
