(4727727, 681636, 59029, '<td valign="top">very colourful, love the angle you got them from. 9</td>', 'very colourful, love the angle you got them from. 9', '2008-05-27 17:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727765, 681954, 70181, '<td valign="top">Wow.  All kinds of crazy lines here and there and everywhere.  But I think it works.  Gives you a real sense of what went into manning one of these ships.  Such intricate work.</td>', 'Wow.  All kinds of crazy lines here and there and everywhere.  But I think it works.  Gives you a real sense of what went into manning one of these ships.  Such intricate work.', '2008-05-27 17:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727766, 682023, 65234, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Looks too much like smoke swirling around a toy boat.  The illusion might have worked better with the boat in water or somehow appearing to be in water.  That said, lighting is kind of fun and it''s a very cool toy boat.</td>', 'Hmm.  Looks too much like smoke swirling around a toy boat.  The illusion might have worked better with the boat in water or somehow appearing to be in water.  That said, lighting is kind of fun and it''s a very cool toy boat.', '2008-05-27 17:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727768, 681657, 70181, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Nice and sharp with a beautiful sky.  Great photo.</td>', 'Great composition.  Nice and sharp with a beautiful sky.  Great photo.', '2008-05-27 17:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727772, 681406, 70181, '<td valign="top">I love this one.  The overall gray/silver monotone look works perfectly.  Nice peaceful scene with a great reflection.  Very well done.</td>', 'I love this one.  The overall gray/silver monotone look works perfectly.  Nice peaceful scene with a great reflection.  Very well done.', '2008-05-27 18:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727773, 681783, 70181, '<td valign="top">At first, I wasn''t sure about the blue tinting, but the more I look at it, the more I like it.  Nice setup and composition.  Just enough going on in the sky to make it interesting without taking focus from the boat and the man.  One of the top 5 shots in the challenge.</td>', 'At first, I wasn''t sure about the blue tinting, but the more I look at it, the more I like it.  Nice setup and composition.  Just enough going on in the sky to make it interesting without taking focus from the boat and the man.  One of the top 5 shots in the challenge.', '2008-05-27 18:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727775, 682177, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not really a good color for a river, is it?  And from the looks of the water line on the boat it appears to be rather caustic.<br/> <br/>I think I would have changed the color of the blue rope to something less vivid (maybe brown to blend in) and probably straightened the boat or tilted it more dramatically.  The tilt as it appears doesn''t strike me as intentional.</td>', 'Not really a good color for a river, is it?  And from the looks of the water line on the boat it appears to be rather caustic. I think I would have changed the color of the blue rope to something less vivid (maybe brown to blend in) and probably straightened the boat or tilted it more dramatically.  The tilt as it appears doesn''t strike me as intentional.', '2008-05-27 18:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727778, 681216, 65234, '<td valign="top">It does look festive, but not like there are any people there (which I only noticed because the title made me expect some).  Shot looks a little soft.</td>', 'It does look festive, but not like there are any people there (which I only noticed because the title made me expect some).  Shot looks a little soft.', '2008-05-27 18:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727783, 682084, 77192, '<td valign="top">amazing colours!</td>', 'amazing colours!', '2008-05-27 18:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727790, 682086, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks well-used with all those scratches.<br/> <br/>Shot feels busy to me.  It''s actually kind of fun to crop it down to just a bit of boat and the plant in front because it looks like a giant tongue licking the plant, but I''m not sure how that would play in a Boat challenge ;-)  I might try some different angles or crops to see if that made it less busy, but that''s me.</td>', 'Looks well-used with all those scratches. Shot feels busy to me.  It''s actually kind of fun to crop it down to just a bit of boat and the plant in front because it looks like a giant tongue licking the plant, but I''m not sure how that would play in a Boat challenge ;-)  I might try some different angles or crops to see if that made it less busy, but that''s me.', '2008-05-27 18:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727797, 681732, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and colors, though a teensy bit overexposed on my monitor.</td>', 'Nice perspective and colors, though a teensy bit overexposed on my monitor.', '2008-05-27 18:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727805, 681975, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit flat to me.</td>', 'Looks a bit flat to me.', '2008-05-27 18:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727810, 681103, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''m a little confused by the obvious immobility of the ship and the motion blur of the shot.  Just don''t think that works for me.</td>', 'I''m a little confused by the obvious immobility of the ship and the motion blur of the shot.  Just don''t think that works for me.', '2008-05-27 18:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727816, 681566, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image.  Would like to have seen the nose on the boats at the bottom though.</td>', 'This is a nice image.  Would like to have seen the nose on the boats at the bottom though.', '2008-05-27 18:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727819, 682161, 78757, '<td valign="top">This feels like it''s more about the sky than the boats.<br/> <br/>Pretty though.</td>', 'This feels like it''s more about the sky than the boats. Pretty though.', '2008-05-27 18:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727826, 682096, 78757, '<td valign="top">focus seems soft.</td>', 'focus seems soft.', '2008-05-27 18:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727868, 681962, 18586, '<td valign="top">Nice one!</td>', 'Nice one!', '2008-05-27 18:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727877, 680150, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the composition; blue looks oversaturated on my monitor.</td>', 'Like the composition; blue looks oversaturated on my monitor.', '2008-05-27 18:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727882, 682075, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and I like the look of the weathered wood and the stormy-looking sky.  It does feel like the beginnings of an adventure.</td>', 'Great perspective and I like the look of the weathered wood and the stormy-looking sky.  It does feel like the beginnings of an adventure.', '2008-05-27 19:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727883, 682190, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oooh, nice tones and very stormy feel.  I like the angle, too.  It''s tough to get a decent shot with so many boats; putting the water and dock in the foreground solved that problem nicely.</td>', 'Oooh, nice tones and very stormy feel.  I like the angle, too.  It''s tough to get a decent shot with so many boats; putting the water and dock in the foreground solved that problem nicely.', '2008-05-27 19:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727884, 682094, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely, dreamy effect here that makes me feel the boat is going to magically shed its confining vines and sail through the forest.  Maybe with fairies aboard.</td>', 'Lovely, dreamy effect here that makes me feel the boat is going to magically shed its confining vines and sail through the forest.  Maybe with fairies aboard.', '2008-05-27 19:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727885, 681962, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene and I like the processing.</td>', 'Lovely scene and I like the processing.', '2008-05-27 19:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727886, 681406, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very calm scene, nicely presented.</td>', 'Very calm scene, nicely presented.', '2008-05-27 19:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727887, 682022, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great golden tones, and the boat stands out nicely.</td>', 'Great golden tones, and the boat stands out nicely.', '2008-05-27 19:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727888, 682183, 65234, '<td valign="top">The light on the boats is wonderful.  Sky doesn''t look real to me but it works with the blackish grass and the silver boats.</td>', 'The light on the boats is wonderful.  Sky doesn''t look real to me but it works with the blackish grass and the silver boats.', '2008-05-27 19:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727889, 680905, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the different expressions :-)</td>', 'Love the different expressions :-)', '2008-05-27 19:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727890, 681967, 65234, '<td valign="top">I don''t generally care for IR but this is pretty.</td>', 'I don''t generally care for IR but this is pretty.', '2008-05-27 19:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727891, 681976, 65234, '<td valign="top">Impressive rust!  Generally like the perspective but kind of wish you hadn''t cut off the bits on the left.</td>', 'Impressive rust!  Generally like the perspective but kind of wish you hadn''t cut off the bits on the left.', '2008-05-27 19:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727892, 682061, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice clean lines and shapes, especially with the reflection.</td>', 'Very nice clean lines and shapes, especially with the reflection.', '2008-05-27 19:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727895, 682171, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I would have had a hard time finding the boat without the pink of the (presumable) fisherperson''s clothes, but they took me straight there.  Different, but I like it.</td>', 'Interesting.  I would have had a hard time finding the boat without the pink of the (presumable) fisherperson''s clothes, but they took me straight there.  Different, but I like it.', '2008-05-27 19:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727897, 681996, 65234, '<td valign="top">Patriotic sort of reflection (if you happen to have those colors in your flag, of course).  Nice shapes and composition.</td>', 'Patriotic sort of reflection (if you happen to have those colors in your flag, of course).  Nice shapes and composition.', '2008-05-27 19:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727898, 681400, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awesome clouds; scene would feel even more idyllic to me if the water reflected more of that color.</td>', 'Awesome clouds; scene would feel even more idyllic to me if the water reflected more of that color.', '2008-05-27 19:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727899, 681410, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yikes; ghost ship!</td>', 'Yikes; ghost ship!', '2008-05-27 19:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727900, 681714, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the queue of pelicans :-)  Makes this an infinitely more fun shot, as I imagine them getting on their own yacht and heading out for a cruise.</td>', 'Love the queue of pelicans :-)  Makes this an infinitely more fun shot, as I imagine them getting on their own yacht and heading out for a cruise.', '2008-05-27 19:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727901, 681423, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the boat, water and sky.  B&amp;W enhances a stormy sort of feel.</td>', 'Nice detail in the boat, water and sky.  B&W enhances a stormy sort of feel.', '2008-05-27 19:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727902, 682197, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and harmonious tones.</td>', 'Nice shapes and harmonious tones.', '2008-05-27 19:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727903, 682123, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed and I love that there is a seagull just next to the boat.  I''m not sure if the person adds to the composition or not.</td>', 'Nicely framed and I love that there is a seagull just next to the boat.  I''m not sure if the person adds to the composition or not.', '2008-05-27 19:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727904, 682003, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light in the water.  Interesting processing effect; looks kind of like a pencil drawing.  Feels a little crowded in the foreground; I like it better with the dock cropped out.</td>', 'Nice light in the water.  Interesting processing effect; looks kind of like a pencil drawing.  Feels a little crowded in the foreground; I like it better with the dock cropped out.', '2008-05-27 19:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727905, 681872, 65234, '<td valign="top">But afloat!  Quite the contrast between the color of the paper boat and the drab water and plants.  Crop feels a little too wide on the left to me.</td>', 'But afloat!  Quite the contrast between the color of the paper boat and the drab water and plants.  Crop feels a little too wide on the left to me.', '2008-05-27 19:04:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4727906, 682050, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks rather idyllic and I like the light on the sails.</td>', 'Looks rather idyllic and I like the light on the sails.', '2008-05-27 19:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727907, 681973, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks quite desolate.  I think I would like the midtones lightened and then saturated a bit to provide more contrast with the decrepit boat.</td>', 'Looks quite desolate.  I think I would like the midtones lightened and then saturated a bit to provide more contrast with the decrepit boat.', '2008-05-27 19:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727908, 681786, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the complementary colors of the two boats.</td>', 'Like the complementary colors of the two boats.', '2008-05-27 19:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4727913, 681223, 65234, '<td valign="top">Look at that sky!!  Rather overwhelms the boat but then boats are always at the mercy of nature, no matter how secure we humans feel on them.</td>', 'Look at that sky!!  Rather overwhelms the boat but then boats are always at the mercy of nature, no matter how secure we humans feel on them.', '2008-05-27 19:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728069, 682064, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject.  That said, I hate your pp.  Why did you overprocess this beautiful image?  This is an example of the evils of photoshop.  Sorry to be so gruff!   But, I see a potentially great photo here!  I''m so disappointed you''ve caused such haloes around the masts with dodge/burn and destroyed the shadow/highlight interplay in the ship.  The sky looks like end-of-days.  There are horrid, black/dark gray vignettes in the upper left and top.  This is not an image anyone would every see with one''s eyes.  You''ve jumped over the edge of image manipulation.  I certainly hope you''ll accept these heartfelt comments as constructive criticism.</td>', 'Great composition and subject.  That said, I hate your pp.  Why did you overprocess this beautiful image?  This is an example of the evils of photoshop.  Sorry to be so gruff!   But, I see a potentially great photo here!  I''m so disappointed you''ve caused such haloes around the masts with dodge/burn and destroyed the shadow/highlight interplay in the ship.  The sky looks like end-of-days.  There are horrid, black/dark gray vignettes in the upper left and top.  This is not an image anyone would every see with one''s eyes.  You''ve jumped over the edge of image manipulation.  I certainly hope you''ll accept these heartfelt comments as constructive criticism.', '2008-05-27 21:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728094, 682094, 33672, '<td valign="top">NIce idea, but seems a bit oversharpened</td>', 'NIce idea, but seems a bit oversharpened', '2008-05-27 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728095, 682022, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great tones. Beautiful comp.</td>', 'Great tones. Beautiful comp.', '2008-05-27 21:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728096, 681952, 33672, '<td valign="top">Busy, but with nice tones.</td>', 'Busy, but with nice tones.', '2008-05-27 21:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728112, 682064, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful vessal</td>', 'Beautiful vessal', '2008-05-27 21:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728114, 681998, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ship and tones.</td>', 'Beautiful ship and tones.', '2008-05-27 21:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728127, 682064, 67237, '<td valign="top">this looks so cartoonish..a bit too much tonemapping for my taste</td>', 'this looks so cartoonish..a bit too much tonemapping for my taste', '2008-05-27 21:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728129, 682047, 67237, '<td valign="top">nice panning</td>', 'nice panning', '2008-05-27 21:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728145, 681967, 33672, '<td valign="top">Silky smooth.</td>', 'Silky smooth.', '2008-05-27 21:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728149, 680438, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love original thinking. Nice diagonal comp.</td>', 'I love original thinking. Nice diagonal comp.', '2008-05-27 21:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4728155, 682073, 33672, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting.</td>', 'Looks like a painting.', '2008-05-27 21:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
