(4730068, 681885, 30982, '<td valign="top">Another shot where the birds make the image - boats and birds seem inextricably tied.  The placement of the foreground/lead bird is perfect for this composition.</td>', 'Another shot where the birds make the image - boats and birds seem inextricably tied.  The placement of the foreground/lead bird is perfect for this composition.', '2008-05-28 12:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
