(4730071, 681140, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably find that this won''t do very well - toys rarely do.  Decent shot with nice focus on the "driver" - looks as though you provided a nice wake behind the boat as well.</td>', 'You''ll probably find that this won''t do very well - toys rarely do.  Decent shot with nice focus on the "driver" - looks as though you provided a nice wake behind the boat as well.', '2008-05-28 12:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730073, 681872, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge.  A bit dosconcerting at first because the "outside" of the boat blends so well with its surroundings that it''s hard to see at first but I kinda dig that lamp on there.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge.  A bit dosconcerting at first because the "outside" of the boat blends so well with its surroundings that it''s hard to see at first but I kinda dig that lamp on there.', '2008-05-28 12:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
