(4730103, 681986, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Yes, that is indeed a "boat", though I fear there will be voters who don''t see it as such.  Lovely, well-kept boat, too.</td>', 'LOL!  Yes, that is indeed a "boat", though I fear there will be voters who don''t see it as such.  Lovely, well-kept boat, too.', '2008-05-28 13:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730105, 681954, 30982, '<td valign="top">Too busy for some, I''m sure, but I rather like the mass of rigging - shows the complexity of the vessel well.</td>', 'Too busy for some, I''m sure, but I rather like the mass of rigging - shows the complexity of the vessel well.', '2008-05-28 13:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730106, 682084, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color study!</td>', 'Wonderful color study!', '2008-05-28 13:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730107, 682150, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent feeling of serenity here.  You may get dinged for having the mast so close to the top, but I think the strength of this composition, the "feel", and the lovely tones will carry it well, and suspect it is scoring well, too.</td>', 'Excellent feeling of serenity here.  You may get dinged for having the mast so close to the top, but I think the strength of this composition, the "feel", and the lovely tones will carry it well, and suspect it is scoring well, too.', '2008-05-28 13:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730114, 681975, 92874, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but seems more like a drawing and very 2D than a photograph to me. Perhaps just a little bit more detail would give more depth to the image for me.</td>', 'Nice idea, but seems more like a drawing and very 2D than a photograph to me. Perhaps just a little bit more detail would give more depth to the image for me.', '2008-05-28 13:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730119, 681103, 92874, '<td valign="top">Image seems to be blured to me. Perhaps camera shake?? Maybe mirror lock up may have helped if you were using a SLR camera and on a tripod.</td>', 'Image seems to be blured to me. Perhaps camera shake?? Maybe mirror lock up may have helped if you were using a SLR camera and on a tripod.', '2008-05-28 13:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730125, 681990, 92874, '<td valign="top">I can make out the sail boat in the centre but can''t quite grasp what you were trying to achieve with the complete image.</td>', 'I can make out the sail boat in the centre but can''t quite grasp what you were trying to achieve with the complete image.', '2008-05-28 13:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730133, 681140, 92874, '<td valign="top">Great creativity as i guess you were faced with a lack of subjects. Great work!</td>', 'Great creativity as i guess you were faced with a lack of subjects. Great work!', '2008-05-28 13:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730212, 682093, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good capture of a working boat in its environment.  Love all the birds, and the busy background of a bustling city.  Maybe just a tad oversharpened - a bit extra-crispy if you will.</td>', 'A good capture of a working boat in its environment.  Love all the birds, and the busy background of a bustling city.  Maybe just a tad oversharpened - a bit extra-crispy if you will.', '2008-05-28 13:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730216, 682086, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I recognize the object as being boat related but that could be my lack of knowledge of boats.  The shot itself is rather pleasing in a quiet sort of way, and has excellent color and detail.</td>', 'I''m not sure I recognize the object as being boat related but that could be my lack of knowledge of boats.  The shot itself is rather pleasing in a quiet sort of way, and has excellent color and detail.', '2008-05-28 13:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730217, 682175, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great catch of disproportion!  Some of those boats are freakin'' huge, yes?  Lots ''o money.  Good title as well.</td>', 'Great catch of disproportion!  Some of those boats are freakin'' huge, yes?  Lots ''o money.  Good title as well.', '2008-05-28 13:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730243, 681990, 90658, '<td valign="top">Art speaks differently to different people.  This is just a case of not pleasing ME, but I''m sure others will totally get this.</td>', 'Art speaks differently to different people.  This is just a case of not pleasing ME, but I''m sure others will totally get this.', '2008-05-28 13:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730246, 682189, 90658, '<td valign="top">The reflection adds a bit of whimsy.  I hear a litte vlice in my head saying "me too, me too, me too."  Overall the lighting could be a weensy bit brighter, but it could be my monitor.</td>', 'The reflection adds a bit of whimsy.  I hear a litte vlice in my head saying "me too, me too, me too."  Overall the lighting could be a weensy bit brighter, but it could be my monitor.', '2008-05-28 13:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730251, 681783, 90658, '<td valign="top">Way to take a very cliche shot and change it up.  I think you''ve got a bit too much sky...or not enough.  What would happen if you cropped about 1/4 inch of the water?  Bringing the composition of the boat down.  Then the sky would have more impact.  Going the other way, cropping the sky a bit will center the boat more.<br/> <br/>The difference here is defining your subject better.  If it''s the boat, crip the sky; if it''s the guy in the bow, crop the water.</td>', 'Way to take a very cliche shot and change it up.  I think you''ve got a bit too much sky...or not enough.  What would happen if you cropped about 1/4 inch of the water?  Bringing the composition of the boat down.  Then the sky would have more impact.  Going the other way, cropping the sky a bit will center the boat more. The difference here is defining your subject better.  If it''s the boat, crip the sky; if it''s the guy in the bow, crop the water.', '2008-05-28 14:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730258, 681503, 90658, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  I like what you''re doing here.  Slight tweaking of the cropping to make exact mirror images would be better.  See the sides of the boats, you have more of the gunnel on the right, then the left.<br/> <br/>Your centering, right now is spot on...so you would need to fix the slight tilt to the left to correct the skew created by widening your shot.</td>', 'Hmm.  I like what you''re doing here.  Slight tweaking of the cropping to make exact mirror images would be better.  See the sides of the boats, you have more of the gunnel on the right, then the left. Your centering, right now is spot on...so you would need to fix the slight tilt to the left to correct the skew created by widening your shot.', '2008-05-28 14:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730259, 682196, 90658, '<td valign="top">Not really to my liking.</td>', 'Not really to my liking.', '2008-05-28 14:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
