(4730278, 682073, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting, in that the boats are part of the larger picture.  I think I really like this one.</td>', 'Interesting, in that the boats are part of the larger picture.  I think I really like this one.', '2008-05-28 14:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
