(4730323, 682110, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is totally unexpected and I rather enjoy it.</td>', 'This is totally unexpected and I rather enjoy it.', '2008-05-28 14:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730330, 682003, 90658, '<td valign="top">I feel like this is over-processed.  The colors are not working together in a cohesive manner.  I am also drawn to the sky and dock.  I had to work too hard to see the boat.<br/> <br/>On the other-hand, if the challenge were leading lines, or water or something totally different, the boat would add a lot to the story line.</td>', 'I feel like this is over-processed.  The colors are not working together in a cohesive manner.  I am also drawn to the sky and dock.  I had to work too hard to see the boat. On the other-hand, if the challenge were leading lines, or water or something totally different, the boat would add a lot to the story line.', '2008-05-28 14:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730332, 682094, 90658, '<td valign="top">Post-processing to perfection.  You have captured in digital format what I think Monet might have painted if he saw this image.  You have met my personal rule of processing...if you do it, go all the way to create something unexpected.  Thank you!</td>', 'Post-processing to perfection.  You have captured in digital format what I think Monet might have painted if he saw this image.  You have met my personal rule of processing...if you do it, go all the way to create something unexpected.  Thank you!', '2008-05-28 14:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730340, 680936, 90658, '<td valign="top">My only suggestion is something that you couldn''t control...I would like to see at least a profile, preferably 3/4 of the face.  There is no emotion communicated here.  Are his (I hope it''s a guy) arms out in excitement, joy, fear, asking for help...as his oar is obviouly missing?  See what I mean?!</td>', 'My only suggestion is something that you couldn''t control...I would like to see at least a profile, preferably 3/4 of the face.  There is no emotion communicated here.  Are his (I hope it''s a guy) arms out in excitement, joy, fear, asking for help...as his oar is obviouly missing?  See what I mean?!', '2008-05-28 14:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
