(4730355, 682092, 90658, '<td valign="top">The more interesting aspect of this shot is the wreckage on the lower left.  I would have made that my shot and left out the rest of the harbor and all of the other boats.</td>', 'The more interesting aspect of this shot is the wreckage on the lower left.  I would have made that my shot and left out the rest of the harbor and all of the other boats.', '2008-05-28 14:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
