(4730359, 681962, 90658, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the over processing that generally happens around this site, but you have managed to find the perfect spot, imo.<br/> <br/>I always tell people, "if you''re going to over-process, go all the way to create something unexpected, otherwise you''re just playing."  You created something unexpected.</td>', 'I don''t like the over processing that generally happens around this site, but you have managed to find the perfect spot, imo. I always tell people, "if you''re going to over-process, go all the way to create something unexpected, otherwise you''re just playing."  You created something unexpected.', '2008-05-28 14:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730361, 681996, 90658, '<td valign="top">This an extremely interesting art shot.  Without the benefit of the title, I would have no idea that a boat was remotely involved in this.  I''m willing to bet that you don''t score well as too many people are going to feel this way.</td>', 'This an extremely interesting art shot.  Without the benefit of the title, I would have no idea that a boat was remotely involved in this.  I''m willing to bet that you don''t score well as too many people are going to feel this way.', '2008-05-28 14:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4730365, 682087, 90658, '<td valign="top">Seems like a snapshot to me.  Perhaps the lighting is your downfall.  I generally prefer natural lighting, but this time, it doesn''t work.</td>', 'Seems like a snapshot to me.  Perhaps the lighting is your downfall.  I generally prefer natural lighting, but this time, it doesn''t work.', '2008-05-28 14:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
