(4731943, 682187, 2490, '<td valign="top">Obviously there was a camera in harm''s way! 8</td>', 'Obviously there was a camera in harm''s way! 8', '2008-05-29 02:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731944, 681685, 2490, '<td valign="top">Very dull color.</td>', 'Very dull color.', '2008-05-29 02:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731948, 681990, 2490, '<td valign="top">Imagine an abstract boat. Here''s some points just for being brave.</td>', 'Imagine an abstract boat. Here''s some points just for being brave.', '2008-05-29 02:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731949, 681156, 53964, '<td valign="top">The rails trailing off into the distance just add the finishing touch :)<br/>Lovely!</td>', 'The rails trailing off into the distance just add the finishing touch :)Lovely!', '2008-05-29 02:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731950, 681282, 2490, '<td valign="top">All those lines leading out of the picture make the focal point hard to find.  Confusing, in a way.</td>', 'All those lines leading out of the picture make the focal point hard to find.  Confusing, in a way.', '2008-05-29 02:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731951, 682022, 2490, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if my display is frigged up or if you''ve got banding.  We''ll assume it''s me for now...</td>', 'I can''t tell if my display is frigged up or if you''ve got banding.  We''ll assume it''s me for now...', '2008-05-29 02:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731952, 681565, 2490, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but I like the colors.</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but I like the colors.', '2008-05-29 02:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731953, 681961, 2490, '<td valign="top">Wow, lotsa blue.</td>', 'Wow, lotsa blue.', '2008-05-29 02:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731956, 681720, 2490, '<td valign="top">I would so love to be there.</td>', 'I would so love to be there.', '2008-05-29 02:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731958, 681423, 2490, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective.  I also like the BW treatment. 8</td>', 'Excellent perspective.  I also like the BW treatment. 8', '2008-05-29 02:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731960, 682072, 2490, '<td valign="top">Kind of abstract.  I would, I think, have liked a wider crop with more information.</td>', 'Kind of abstract.  I would, I think, have liked a wider crop with more information.', '2008-05-29 02:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731961, 682125, 2490, '<td valign="top">That''s borderline hilarious, but there''s probably a part of the joke that I don''t even realize.</td>', 'That''s borderline hilarious, but there''s probably a part of the joke that I don''t even realize.', '2008-05-29 02:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731963, 681807, 2490, '<td valign="top">Love the shallow DOF, but the bright spot top center keeps dragging my eye away from the boat.  Boat colors need to be richer and slightly redder.</td>', 'Love the shallow DOF, but the bright spot top center keeps dragging my eye away from the boat.  Boat colors need to be richer and slightly redder.', '2008-05-29 02:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731964, 680049, 2490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful boat shot.  Too bad about the trees.</td>', 'Beautiful boat shot.  Too bad about the trees.', '2008-05-29 02:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731965, 680438, 2490, '<td valign="top">Somehow the "Boat" is too far from the rule of thirds lines and it is hard to find.  Need to make it stand out if that''s what the picture is really all about.</td>', 'Somehow the "Boat" is too far from the rule of thirds lines and it is hard to find.  Need to make it stand out if that''s what the picture is really all about.', '2008-05-29 02:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731967, 682098, 2490, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  If the sky were just a touch less hot, it would be a 10.</td>', 'Awesome shot.  If the sky were just a touch less hot, it would be a 10.', '2008-05-29 02:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731969, 682186, 2490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful boats, but the trees steal something from them.</td>', 'Beautiful boats, but the trees steal something from them.', '2008-05-29 02:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731970, 681816, 2490, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a touch dark.</td>', 'Nice shot but a touch dark.', '2008-05-29 02:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731971, 681162, 2490, '<td valign="top">Stupid gull :)  I think i would like to see a little more contrast in the shot, but maybe it''s the multiple shades of blue that makes me a little "uncomfortable".</td>', 'Stupid gull :)  I think i would like to see a little more contrast in the shot, but maybe it''s the multiple shades of blue that makes me a little "uncomfortable".', '2008-05-29 02:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731972, 681604, 2490, '<td valign="top">This is wicked good.  I''m still trying to figure out whether these are real boats or if that''s Stuart Little.</td>', 'This is wicked good.  I''m still trying to figure out whether these are real boats or if that''s Stuart Little.', '2008-05-29 02:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731973, 680936, 2490, '<td valign="top">These are hard shots to capture.  You''ve done really well, but his face would be a crowning touch.</td>', 'These are hard shots to capture.  You''ve done really well, but his face would be a crowning touch.', '2008-05-29 02:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731975, 682177, 2490, '<td valign="top">Getting rid of that blue hose / rope would have added two or three points to my vote.</td>', 'Getting rid of that blue hose / rope would have added two or three points to my vote.', '2008-05-29 02:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731976, 682197, 2490, '<td valign="top">My eye kind of runs around looking for something to settle on and consider important.</td>', 'My eye kind of runs around looking for something to settle on and consider important.', '2008-05-29 02:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731978, 682087, 2490, '<td valign="top">Crop it tighter and get her out of the center.</td>', 'Crop it tighter and get her out of the center.', '2008-05-29 02:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731979, 682098, 53964, '<td valign="top">I see an iceberg... this must be Karen''s :)</td>', 'I see an iceberg... this must be Karen''s :)', '2008-05-29 02:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731980, 682180, 2490, '<td valign="top">i like the boat.  I''m not sure if you''re trying to make it look old, or if it''s just a little drab.</td>', 'i like the boat.  I''m not sure if you''re trying to make it look old, or if it''s just a little drab.', '2008-05-29 02:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731982, 681736, 2490, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of anti-selective desat these days, but this is well done.</td>', 'I''m kind of anti-selective desat these days, but this is well done.', '2008-05-29 02:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731983, 681714, 2490, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern, but the crop is too loose.</td>', 'I like the pattern, but the crop is too loose.', '2008-05-29 02:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731984, 682013, 2490, '<td valign="top">Seems too centered, but I can see why you would do that intentionally.</td>', 'Seems too centered, but I can see why you would do that intentionally.', '2008-05-29 02:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731986, 680637, 2490, '<td valign="top">Ahh.  Good composition, light, and subject.  I like it.</td>', 'Ahh.  Good composition, light, and subject.  I like it.', '2008-05-29 02:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731988, 682106, 2490, '<td valign="top">Very well lit, no pun intended.</td>', 'Very well lit, no pun intended.', '2008-05-29 02:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731989, 681984, 2490, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of hi-key.  i doubt you''ll do well, but it''s a great job.</td>', 'I''m a big fan of hi-key.  i doubt you''ll do well, but it''s a great job.', '2008-05-29 02:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731990, 682094, 2490, '<td valign="top">Too much green, but I understand it''s important to the shot.</td>', 'Too much green, but I understand it''s important to the shot.', '2008-05-29 02:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731991, 681546, 2490, '<td valign="top">I like it.  8</td>', 'I like it.  8', '2008-05-29 02:21:45.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4731992, 681952, 2490, '<td valign="top">A LITTLE bit flat in the foreground.  Great shot, though!</td>', 'A LITTLE bit flat in the foreground.  Great shot, though!', '2008-05-29 02:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731994, 681223, 2490, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a really good job of establishing depth and perspective.  This is an awesome shot.</td>', 'You''ve done a really good job of establishing depth and perspective.  This is an awesome shot.', '2008-05-29 02:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731995, 681154, 2490, '<td valign="top">Love the boats.  7</td>', 'Love the boats.  7', '2008-05-29 02:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4731999, 681976, 2490, '<td valign="top">Ah, the old rusty ship on a bluesky day.  I like it, but the nose connecting into something over my head makes for an intense feeling of being there.</td>', 'Ah, the old rusty ship on a bluesky day.  I like it, but the nose connecting into something over my head makes for an intense feeling of being there.', '2008-05-29 02:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732000, 681160, 2490, '<td valign="top">Lots of yellow... all in one place.  Maybe a little too much.</td>', 'Lots of yellow... all in one place.  Maybe a little too much.', '2008-05-29 02:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732002, 681140, 2490, '<td valign="top">:)  I doubt you''ll do well with this, but he''s a cute little guy.</td>', ':)  I doubt you''ll do well with this, but he''s a cute little guy.', '2008-05-29 02:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732004, 682173, 2490, '<td valign="top">Toys are fun, but they just don''t do well on DOC.</td>', 'Toys are fun, but they just don''t do well on DOC.', '2008-05-29 02:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732006, 681986, 2490, '<td valign="top">Being up on a ladder or something and looking down on the car just enough to have the name of the boat clearly showing above the car roof would have been a tremendou improvment.</td>', 'Being up on a ladder or something and looking down on the car just enough to have the name of the boat clearly showing above the car roof would have been a tremendou improvment.', '2008-05-29 02:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732007, 681251, 2490, '<td valign="top">Too "thoughtsy'' for me.</td>', 'Too "thoughtsy'' for me.', '2008-05-29 02:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732010, 681967, 2490, '<td valign="top">That''s absolutely incredibly gorgeous.</td>', 'That''s absolutely incredibly gorgeous.', '2008-05-29 02:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732015, 681091, 2490, '<td valign="top">I call winner.</td>', 'I call winner.', '2008-05-29 02:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732040, 682064, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but watch your HDR halos.</td>', 'Nice composition but watch your HDR halos.', '2008-05-29 02:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732078, 682017, 14867, '<td valign="top">Not unpleasant with nice vivid blue and attractive mood.<br/>This said, the composition is <u>very</u> busy, the eye can hardly find its way into your image.<br/>Some issues with postprocesing too: there are strange shadow lines near the mast and trees, above.</td>', 'Not unpleasant with nice vivid blue and attractive mood.This said, the composition is very busy, the eye can hardly find its way into your image.Some issues with postprocesing too: there are strange shadow lines near the mast and trees, above.', '2008-05-29 03:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732084, 681973, 14867, '<td valign="top">Good subject well composed.<br/>Needs indeed a sad mood, but the light is here more flat than sad.</td>', 'Good subject well composed.Needs indeed a sad mood, but the light is here more flat than sad.', '2008-05-29 03:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732098, 682050, 14867, '<td valign="top">The water is globally too dark and the light with an obvious dodging work on the sails seems unnatural.<br/>The composition, although serene, is not very exciting with much empty sky and water. (by the way, there are a lot af sensor dusts visible in the sky)</td>', 'The water is globally too dark and the light with an obvious dodging work on the sails seems unnatural.The composition, although serene, is not very exciting with much empty sky and water. (by the way, there are a lot af sensor dusts visible in the sky)', '2008-05-29 03:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732107, 682084, 14867, '<td valign="top">Too busy and too randomly cropped to be a pure abstraction (the buoy is very distracting), but the juxtaposition of primary colors is just fine</td>', 'Too busy and too randomly cropped to be a pure abstraction (the buoy is very distracting), but the juxtaposition of primary colors is just fine', '2008-05-29 03:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732113, 682073, 14867, '<td valign="top">Nice at first sight, a closer look reveals a poor sky''s selection in postprocessing.<br/>Hardly meeting the challenge, the boats are not really the main subject here</td>', 'Nice at first sight, a closer look reveals a poor sky''s selection in postprocessing.Hardly meeting the challenge, the boats are not really the main subject here', '2008-05-29 03:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732183, 681657, 93812, '<td valign="top">Great depth and focus. The boat sets the scale for the grandness of the mountain.</td>', 'Great depth and focus. The boat sets the scale for the grandness of the mountain.', '2008-05-29 04:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732268, 681952, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and the masts in sky play nicely...</td>', 'Nice tones and the masts in sky play nicely...', '2008-05-29 06:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732271, 681962, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice boat and peer...both have seen their day but still get the job done...very nice scene.</td>', 'Nice boat and peer...both have seen their day but still get the job done...very nice scene.', '2008-05-29 06:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732375, 681406, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wow. Now that''s an awesome shot. What a fascinating gradient effect the water is displaying.</td>', 'Wow. Now that''s an awesome shot. What a fascinating gradient effect the water is displaying.', '2008-05-29 09:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732642, 682180, 54645, '<td valign="top">good effort too much noise</td>', 'good effort too much noise', '2008-05-29 11:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732644, 681511, 54645, '<td valign="top">well focused, I don''t like the vignette</td>', 'well focused, I don''t like the vignette', '2008-05-29 11:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732648, 682115, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and color. I can see that you masked the sky. I find the bright cloud destracting, constantly pulling at my attention. This image would look nice in BW as well.</td>', 'I like the composition and color. I can see that you masked the sky. I find the bright cloud destracting, constantly pulling at my attention. This image would look nice in BW as well.', '2008-05-29 11:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732749, 681962, 34134, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I can''t vote in this. BUT, this is an exceptional photo. I love the tones and overall processing. I think the border really adds to the feeling. Great job!</td>', 'Unfortunately I can''t vote in this. BUT, this is an exceptional photo. I love the tones and overall processing. I think the border really adds to the feeling. Great job!', '2008-05-29 12:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732846, 681406, 92572, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot. My absolute favorite.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot. My absolute favorite.', '2008-05-29 13:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732858, 681998, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot.  I think I might prefer the color version.  I would be interested in seeing it in color.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot.  I think I might prefer the color version.  I would be interested in seeing it in color.', '2008-05-29 13:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732860, 681975, 90658, '<td valign="top">Creative use of the model ship.  Was there any way to show more of the hull without showing the stand?  I feel like something is missing at the bottom.</td>', 'Creative use of the model ship.  Was there any way to show more of the hull without showing the stand?  I feel like something is missing at the bottom.', '2008-05-29 13:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732863, 681458, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m finding rit ather difficult to differentiate between the clouds, water and masts.  Could be an issue with the lighting and/or post-processing, or potentially my monitor.</td>', 'I''m finding rit ather difficult to differentiate between the clouds, water and masts.  Could be an issue with the lighting and/or post-processing, or potentially my monitor.', '2008-05-29 14:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732871, 682197, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this except the yellow rope.  This being advanced editing, I''m sure that there something that can be legally done to tone it down.  There is also some focus issues on the hull tip directly above the distracting rope.</td>', 'I like everything about this except the yellow rope.  This being advanced editing, I''m sure that there something that can be legally done to tone it down.  There is also some focus issues on the hull tip directly above the distracting rope.', '2008-05-29 14:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732873, 681885, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is what I was expecting to see more of in this challenge.  There is a simplicity and elegance to this shot.  The gray scale of the water and background also add to it''s mystical quality.  Some slight focus issues at the back of the boat.</td>', 'This is what I was expecting to see more of in this challenge.  There is a simplicity and elegance to this shot.  The gray scale of the water and background also add to it''s mystical quality.  Some slight focus issues at the back of the boat.', '2008-05-29 14:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732876, 681714, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think that I would prefer to see the focus on the ship, not so much on the pelicans.</td>', 'I think that I would prefer to see the focus on the ship, not so much on the pelicans.', '2008-05-29 14:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732879, 681730, 90658, '<td valign="top">Thank you, thank you, thank you for not playing with the coloring in the sky/clouds.  Thank you, thank you, thank you for letting the coloring of the pipes speak for its self.</td>', 'Thank you, thank you, thank you for not playing with the coloring in the sky/clouds.  Thank you, thank you, thank you for letting the coloring of the pipes speak for its self.', '2008-05-29 14:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732882, 681423, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice going with b&amp;w.  You could have just as much impact showing in color and just calling it "Beached."</td>', 'Interesting choice going with b&w.  You could have just as much impact showing in color and just calling it "Beached."', '2008-05-29 14:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732887, 681872, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well, kudos for using catalog/magazine paper for your toy boat.  That adds some visual interest.  But unfortunately, art speaks differently to different people and this just isn''t speaking to me.</td>', 'Well, kudos for using catalog/magazine paper for your toy boat.  That adds some visual interest.  But unfortunately, art speaks differently to different people and this just isn''t speaking to me.', '2008-05-29 14:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732891, 682106, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m working really hard on finding a focal point.  To me it looks like it is the forefront of the deck...eveything behind the natural plank line (near the front ropes) seems oof to me.  Sorry.</td>', 'I''m working really hard on finding a focal point.  To me it looks like it is the forefront of the deck...eveything behind the natural plank line (near the front ropes) seems oof to me.  Sorry.', '2008-05-29 14:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732898, 681770, 90658, '<td valign="top">Catching the sunrise/sunset at that perfect moment shining through the windows of the St. Joseph is wonderful.  Add the pink of the clouds and you have a very surreal, yet subtle shot.  The subtlness is such an opposite to the hard rust lines and obvious strength of the boats.  I bet you get a wide range of scores on this.</td>', 'Catching the sunrise/sunset at that perfect moment shining through the windows of the St. Joseph is wonderful.  Add the pink of the clouds and you have a very surreal, yet subtle shot.  The subtlness is such an opposite to the hard rust lines and obvious strength of the boats.  I bet you get a wide range of scores on this.', '2008-05-29 14:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732901, 682044, 90658, '<td valign="top">This shot could exist with or without the boat, making it very unique to me.  Sometimes when I look at it, I see the landscape first, sometimes the boat is seen first.</td>', 'This shot could exist with or without the boat, making it very unique to me.  Sometimes when I look at it, I see the landscape first, sometimes the boat is seen first.', '2008-05-29 14:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732902, 682182, 90658, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.</td>', 'Simple and effective.', '2008-05-29 14:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732905, 681156, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well done on the composition.  There is a lot of very interesting things to look at.  I think the sepia presentation (or any atonal presentation) sort of makes everything the same...thus you lose some of the dimension that exists naturally.  (I could be wrong, I don''t have the colored shot to compare it to.)</td>', 'Well done on the composition.  There is a lot of very interesting things to look at.  I think the sepia presentation (or any atonal presentation) sort of makes everything the same...thus you lose some of the dimension that exists naturally.  (I could be wrong, I don''t have the colored shot to compare it to.)', '2008-05-29 14:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732909, 681140, 90658, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colors, good front lighting, nice shading.</td>', 'Nice vibrant colors, good front lighting, nice shading.', '2008-05-29 14:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732913, 682017, 90658, '<td valign="top">So much going on here.  The boats are really the last thing I see.  What does this look like in the daylight?</td>', 'So much going on here.  The boats are really the last thing I see.  What does this look like in the daylight?', '2008-05-29 14:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732917, 682047, 90658, '<td valign="top">Fantastic motion shot!  I can almost hear the sirens blaring.</td>', 'Fantastic motion shot!  I can almost hear the sirens blaring.', '2008-05-29 14:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732921, 681210, 90658, '<td valign="top">Almost too far out of the box.  I wonder how many DNMCs you get on this one.  I, however, like it and think that these are clearly things you would find in/on a boat, and I see the seat and rust so I know (or at least can imagine) that this was taken IN a boat.  B&amp;W was the perfect choice for this presentation.</td>', 'Almost too far out of the box.  I wonder how many DNMCs you get on this one.  I, however, like it and think that these are clearly things you would find in/on a boat, and I see the seat and rust so I know (or at least can imagine) that this was taken IN a boat.  B&W was the perfect choice for this presentation.', '2008-05-29 14:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732924, 682184, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think a more 90 degree vertical would have been better.  Obviously, you can''t control which direction the boat is traveling so I won''t mark you down for it.</td>', 'I think a more 90 degree vertical would have been better.  Obviously, you can''t control which direction the boat is traveling so I won''t mark you down for it.', '2008-05-29 14:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732927, 682131, 90658, '<td valign="top">Can''t I have both?  Pleeeeeaaaaaase?!<br/> <br/>Nicely done!</td>', 'Can''t I have both?  Pleeeeeaaaaaase?! Nicely done!', '2008-05-29 14:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732929, 682192, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  The whimsy and fun is just jumping off the screen.  I keep thinking that there must be some fairies or water nymphs peeking out from the rocks to enjoy the frivolity.</td>', 'This is wonderful.  The whimsy and fun is just jumping off the screen.  I keep thinking that there must be some fairies or water nymphs peeking out from the rocks to enjoy the frivolity.', '2008-05-29 14:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732930, 682128, 90658, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, effective.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Simple, elegant, effective.  Nicely done.', '2008-05-29 14:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732940, 681976, 90658, '<td valign="top">A bit over processed for me.  For me and the whole HDR/processing stuff, my feeling is this...if you are going to do it, do it to the extent that you create something totally unexpected.  I would exptect to see a rusted wreck with brown, red and algae.  I would not exptect to see a rusted wreck shown in sublte colors (see my point?)  I guess my feeling is really summed up this way...photography is 95% talent, 5% luck.  Digital photograpy is 95% talent, 5% luck and an additionl 50% creativity, reserve the majority of the creativity for taking the <u>talent</u> into the <u>art</u>.<br/> <br/>This shot shows a huge amount of talent, without all of the editing.  I would love to see it as it was before you started "playing" with it.<br/> <br/>I would consider cropping on the left so that the boat just kisses the edge of the shot.  You''ve almost got it, but I still see some blue at the top.</td>', 'A bit over processed for me.  For me and the whole HDR/processing stuff, my feeling is this...if you are going to do it, do it to the extent that you create something totally unexpected.  I would exptect to see a rusted wreck with brown, red and algae.  I would not exptect to see a rusted wreck shown in sublte colors (see my point?)  I guess my feeling is really summed up this way...photography is 95% talent, 5% luck.  Digital photograpy is 95% talent, 5% luck and an additionl 50% creativity, reserve the majority of the creativity for taking the talent into the art. This shot shows a huge amount of talent, without all of the editing.  I would love to see it as it was before you started "playing" with it. I would consider cropping on the left so that the boat just kisses the edge of the shot.  You''ve almost got it, but I still see some blue at the top.', '2008-05-29 14:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4732947, 681167, 90658, '<td valign="top">The simplicity is what does it for me.</td>', 'The simplicity is what does it for me.', '2008-05-29 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
