(4733459, 681811, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s very interesting for sure but something about the edit, for me anyway, is odd.</td>', 'It''s very interesting for sure but something about the edit, for me anyway, is odd.', '2008-05-29 20:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733462, 681986, 62187, '<td valign="top">Such a sweet photo but the focus is too much on the car. Which looks super sweet for sure!</td>', 'Such a sweet photo but the focus is too much on the car. Which looks super sweet for sure!', '2008-05-29 20:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733465, 681807, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice! I like this Boat #92 best so far. Love the focus and crop. 9+2=11 so I''ll round the score to 10.</td>', 'Nice! I like this Boat #92 best so far. Love the focus and crop. 9+2=11 so I''ll round the score to 10.', '2008-05-29 20:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733469, 681372, 62187, '<td valign="top">Instead of ''Adak'' it should be called ''Aten''. Unless it already is and ''dak'' is 10 in a language I don''t understand.</td>', 'Instead of ''Adak'' it should be called ''Aten''. Unless it already is and ''dak'' is 10 in a language I don''t understand.', '2008-05-29 20:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733475, 681954, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, I hope they don''t expect anymore rope because I think they used it all! Very nice focus - that ornament in the front looks really cool.</td>', 'Well, I hope they don''t expect anymore rope because I think they used it all! Very nice focus - that ornament in the front looks really cool.', '2008-05-29 20:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733485, 681565, 62187, '<td valign="top">I want to give it a 10 but it''s not much about Boats to me. It seems to be focused on the building. What the heck: 8</td>', 'I want to give it a 10 but it''s not much about Boats to me. It seems to be focused on the building. What the heck: 8', '2008-05-29 20:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733488, 681819, 62187, '<td valign="top">A tad sharper and that thing in the sky cleaned and I''d give it a 10 for sure. As it is, I still like it and I''ll go with a mediocre 7.</td>', 'A tad sharper and that thing in the sky cleaned and I''d give it a 10 for sure. As it is, I still like it and I''ll go with a mediocre 7.', '2008-05-29 20:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733533, 681954, 51538, '<td valign="top">The boy stood on the burning deck...</td>', 'The boy stood on the burning deck...', '2008-05-29 21:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733539, 682140, 51538, '<td valign="top">For the reason that my daughter is an expert in origami, I look more closely.  Out of the creased boats in this challenge, yours is far and away the best and most creatively presented.  The title is good as well. 8.</td>', 'For the reason that my daughter is an expert in origami, I look more closely.  Out of the creased boats in this challenge, yours is far and away the best and most creatively presented.  The title is good as well. 8.', '2008-05-29 21:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733555, 682073, 51538, '<td valign="top">HDR hurts my eyes sometimes, especially your aggressive use of this sort of processing here.  But the location is simply lovely.  The treatment is, well, I cannot really say since your skin might not be thick enough to not be offended. Let me just say that it does not enhance the image, IMO.  4</td>', 'HDR hurts my eyes sometimes, especially your aggressive use of this sort of processing here.  But the location is simply lovely.  The treatment is, well, I cannot really say since your skin might not be thick enough to not be offended. Let me just say that it does not enhance the image, IMO.  4', '2008-05-29 21:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733579, 682098, 10818, '<td valign="top">The colors work real well.  Great lines with the ship wake.<br/>The iceberg is excellent, don''t see many in Texas.  :)</td>', 'The colors work real well.  Great lines with the ship wake.The iceberg is excellent, don''t see many in Texas.  :)', '2008-05-29 21:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733593, 681289, 10818, '<td valign="top">The fully extended sail looks great against the water and sky.</td>', 'The fully extended sail looks great against the water and sky.', '2008-05-29 22:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733595, 681223, 10818, '<td valign="top">When you see those clouds, you go in the other direction.<br/>Great clouds and sun reflection off the water.  Frame really looks good with this shot.</td>', 'When you see those clouds, you go in the other direction.Great clouds and sun reflection off the water.  Frame really looks good with this shot.', '2008-05-29 22:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733619, 682064, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is the most interesting looking ship in the challenge. Unfortunately, the photo doesn''t do it justice. Congrats on finding such a great subject though. :)</td>', 'This is the most interesting looking ship in the challenge. Unfortunately, the photo doesn''t do it justice. Congrats on finding such a great subject though. :)', '2008-05-29 22:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733632, 681820, 16230, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this looks like yet another victim of the HDR plague. However, even with good processing the photo still wouldn''t score very highly with me because the subject and setting are rather dull and uninteresting.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this looks like yet another victim of the HDR plague. However, even with good processing the photo still wouldn''t score very highly with me because the subject and setting are rather dull and uninteresting.', '2008-05-29 22:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733827, 682120, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is beautiful, awesome colors.<br/>All of the masts look great against the night sky.</td>', 'That is beautiful, awesome colors.All of the masts look great against the night sky.', '2008-05-30 00:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733832, 682189, 10818, '<td valign="top">Really pretty, fantastic contrast in the reflection.</td>', 'Really pretty, fantastic contrast in the reflection.', '2008-05-30 00:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733838, 681251, 10818, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and nice focus.  If the grass was water it would make it more dramatic, but sometimes we can''t control such things.</td>', 'Interesting angle and nice focus.  If the grass was water it would make it more dramatic, but sometimes we can''t control such things.', '2008-05-30 00:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733847, 681657, 10818, '<td valign="top">Those mountains just dwarf that large ship.<br/>Incredible shot, what a fabulous scene.</td>', 'Those mountains just dwarf that large ship.Incredible shot, what a fabulous scene.', '2008-05-30 00:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733854, 681156, 10818, '<td valign="top">Sepia works well, interesting old boat and rail line.</td>', 'Sepia works well, interesting old boat and rail line.', '2008-05-30 00:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4733898, 682064, 54674, '<td valign="top">lots of halos in the rigging which means over sharpened unless that''s the effect you intended<br/> <br/>some vignetting in upper left too</td>', 'lots of halos in the rigging which means over sharpened unless that''s the effect you intended some vignetting in upper left too', '2008-05-30 00:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
