(4733926, 681872, 54674, '<td valign="top">You''ll hear this more than once - grass in front is distracting &amp; gives a voyeuristic feel to the photo</td>', 'You''ll hear this more than once - grass in front is distracting & gives a voyeuristic feel to the photo', '2008-05-30 00:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
