(4734024, 682185, 77724, '<td valign="top">This should make for a nice family memory, you did pretty well for the intense light on the white subject.</td>', 'This should make for a nice family memory, you did pretty well for the intense light on the white subject.', '2008-05-30 02:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
