(4734260, 681160, 92864, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty OOF.</td>', 'Looks pretty OOF.', '2008-05-30 08:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734262, 681685, 92864, '<td valign="top">Looks way underexposed.</td>', 'Looks way underexposed.', '2008-05-30 08:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734418, 681986, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the car. Love the boat. Nice touch to have the guy sitting on the wall. I find bisecting OOSTERDAM with the roof of the car, and the car setting at an angle very distracting (at least the combination of the two - with the bisection being the most disturbing). Nice lighting.</td>', 'Love the car. Love the boat. Nice touch to have the guy sitting on the wall. I find bisecting OOSTERDAM with the roof of the car, and the car setting at an angle very distracting (at least the combination of the two - with the bisection being the most disturbing). Nice lighting.', '2008-05-30 10:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734434, 681400, 77196, '<td valign="top">The bright clouds close to the horizon really make this shot for me.</td>', 'The bright clouds close to the horizon really make this shot for me.', '2008-05-30 10:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734455, 681967, 78110, '<td valign="top">number one! :)</td>', 'number one! :)', '2008-05-30 10:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734475, 681676, 76335, '<td valign="top">This could have been better composed. It takes some work to see what''s going on here. Nice shot though.</td>', 'This could have been better composed. It takes some work to see what''s going on here. Nice shot though.', '2008-05-30 11:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734520, 681967, 15291, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture, love everything about the image top honors in mho.</td>', 'Awesome capture, love everything about the image top honors in mho.', '2008-05-30 11:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734528, 682098, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, Love the composition showing the vast ocean. Wonderful job.</td>', 'Nicely done, Love the composition showing the vast ocean. Wonderful job.', '2008-05-30 11:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734535, 681406, 15291, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture, the front of the boat is a bit out of focus however. In mho this would have been in the running if not for the this.</td>', 'Wonderful capture, the front of the boat is a bit out of focus however. In mho this would have been in the running if not for the this.', '2008-05-30 11:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734540, 681657, 15291, '<td valign="top">Awesome image, love the composition. All the elements are wonderfully done from the boat to the approching weather, Great work!</td>', 'Awesome image, love the composition. All the elements are wonderfully done from the boat to the approching weather, Great work!', '2008-05-30 11:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734544, 682196, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image. It does seem to be under exposed &amp; your focus seems a bit soft.</td>', 'Nice image. It does seem to be under exposed & your focus seems a bit soft.', '2008-05-30 11:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734546, 681984, 15291, '<td valign="top">A nice image. I like the composition, it just seems over exposed &amp; the tonality is off as well.</td>', 'A nice image. I like the composition, it just seems over exposed & the tonality is off as well.', '2008-05-30 11:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734551, 681970, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Different but effective.</td>', 'Great photo. Different but effective.', '2008-05-30 11:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734552, 681820, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice wide angle shot and a great sky.</td>', 'Nice wide angle shot and a great sky.', '2008-05-30 11:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734553, 682182, 33672, '<td valign="top">Exceptional tones.</td>', 'Exceptional tones.', '2008-05-30 11:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734555, 682075, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great pov and sky. Perfect for theme.</td>', 'Great pov and sky. Perfect for theme.', '2008-05-30 11:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734556, 681423, 33672, '<td valign="top">Comp really makes the subject stand out.</td>', 'Comp really makes the subject stand out.', '2008-05-30 11:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734558, 681620, 33672, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the theme.</td>', 'One of the best in the theme.', '2008-05-30 12:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734563, 681091, 15291, '<td valign="top">Awesome image, love  the detail &amp; the fact you used the full frame. If there is one thing I would consider changing is the border, slimmer and maybe a beige the white seems a bit to strong for this image. Great work!</td>', 'Awesome image, love  the detail & the fact you used the full frame. If there is one thing I would consider changing is the border, slimmer and maybe a beige the white seems a bit to strong for this image. Great work!', '2008-05-30 12:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734626, 681811, 93765, '<td valign="top">Sad. A gripping picture. The partial desaturation works nicely. I find the power lines left of the bow and the cylindrical thing to the right of the rudder very disturbing, I''d probably have removed or blurred them.</td>', 'Sad. A gripping picture. The partial desaturation works nicely. I find the power lines left of the bow and the cylindrical thing to the right of the rudder very disturbing, I''d probably have removed or blurred them.', '2008-05-30 13:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734659, 681156, 93765, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!. The use of sepia is a good choice. I was a bit put off by the crop, though. At least until I thought about the symbolism of it. The boat is on its way out of the picture, with just a bit more to go, and a vast shining past behind it. Still disturbing, but more due to nostalgia, then.</td>', 'Nice catch!. The use of sepia is a good choice. I was a bit put off by the crop, though. At least until I thought about the symbolism of it. The boat is on its way out of the picture, with just a bit more to go, and a vast shining past behind it. Still disturbing, but more due to nostalgia, then.', '2008-05-30 13:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734660, 681210, 93765, '<td valign="top">B/W is the obvious choice for this one. Did you try it with more contrast as well? I think I would have tried a diagonal composition instead of the horizontal, as this is a bit - predictable.</td>', 'B/W is the obvious choice for this one. Did you try it with more contrast as well? I think I would have tried a diagonal composition instead of the horizontal, as this is a bit - predictable.', '2008-05-30 13:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734671, 680049, 93765, '<td valign="top">You might have called it "Sunday Sailor" as well, what with the fender still out... The crop and angle are fine, having a dynamic feel. I find there is too much focus on the background, and too little on the sailors, though. All in all, the background is too dominant, sucking the skipper right in. Im not too sure about the cyclist either...</td>', 'You might have called it "Sunday Sailor" as well, what with the fender still out... The crop and angle are fine, having a dynamic feel. I find there is too much focus on the background, and too little on the sailors, though. All in all, the background is too dominant, sucking the skipper right in. Im not too sure about the cyclist either...', '2008-05-30 13:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734679, 682172, 93765, '<td valign="top">Great reflections, but that step sure is distracting. Was there one on the other side as well? And, on a nitpicky note, that is actually a sterndrive and not an outboard - but I guess you''ll hear that from a few others as well... ;)</td>', 'Great reflections, but that step sure is distracting. Was there one on the other side as well? And, on a nitpicky note, that is actually a sterndrive and not an outboard - but I guess you''ll hear that from a few others as well... ;)', '2008-05-30 13:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734690, 682022, 93765, '<td valign="top">Nice! You certainly know your camera - or your Photoshop - or both. Beautiful light, perfect sense of depth, great crop, and the vessel has to be just there. But did it have to be that ugly? Where are the square riggers when you need them...?</td>', 'Nice! You certainly know your camera - or your Photoshop - or both. Beautiful light, perfect sense of depth, great crop, and the vessel has to be just there. But did it have to be that ugly? Where are the square riggers when you need them...?', '2008-05-30 14:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734703, 681410, 93765, '<td valign="top">Lovely! No idea how you got that effect (would be nice to see a break-down), but it delivers. Beautiful colour range.</td>', 'Lovely! No idea how you got that effect (would be nice to see a break-down), but it delivers. Beautiful colour range.', '2008-05-30 14:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734712, 682064, 93765, '<td valign="top">Based on the TN I thought I''d skip it, but I''m glad I didn''t! Great graphic effect, works really well. Just a pity you didn''t get more/the rest of the stern on there as well (or didn''t it work out?). Anyway, your effort was well invested!</td>', 'Based on the TN I thought I''d skip it, but I''m glad I didn''t! Great graphic effect, works really well. Just a pity you didn''t get more/the rest of the stern on there as well (or didn''t it work out?). Anyway, your effort was well invested!', '2008-05-30 14:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734718, 682171, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it falls short to expectations for some reason. I think if the ripple lines were level (horizontal) that would have helped -- also a little more stillness in the water. It''s obvious too fast that this was shot reflected in water.</td>', 'Good idea, but it falls short to expectations for some reason. I think if the ripple lines were level (horizontal) that would have helped -- also a little more stillness in the water. It''s obvious too fast that this was shot reflected in water.', '2008-05-30 14:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734721, 682028, 76335, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more contrast. Great title and idea though.</td>', 'Needs a little more contrast. Great title and idea though.', '2008-05-30 14:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734727, 681630, 93765, '<td valign="top">As a sailor I object to your title. Motoring with the main sail up for stability ain''t the sailing spirit! That may predjudice my opinion of the picture itself. The crop rescues what there is to salvage in an otherwise somewhat undramatic scene.</td>', 'As a sailor I object to your title. Motoring with the main sail up for stability ain''t the sailing spirit! That may predjudice my opinion of the picture itself. The crop rescues what there is to salvage in an otherwise somewhat undramatic scene.', '2008-05-30 14:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734741, 682125, 76335, '<td valign="top">Points for your twisted sense of humor.</td>', 'Points for your twisted sense of humor.', '2008-05-30 14:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734750, 681990, 93765, '<td valign="top">To quote a term frequently used around here for abstracts: " what is it". (Just had to wright it, never mind, insider joke). I''m not into analysing modern art, so I won''t even try that approach. Lots of details in there that tickle the fantasy (dolphin head, cling foil stretch, headless torso, boatish silhouette, light textures). I like the overall effect as well. Great picture! Great title too, as such, but I fail to make the connection... <br/>(Sorry, I''m not allowed to vote, so I can''t boost your average.)</td>', 'To quote a term frequently used around here for abstracts: " what is it". (Just had to wright it, never mind, insider joke). I''m not into analysing modern art, so I won''t even try that approach. Lots of details in there that tickle the fantasy (dolphin head, cling foil stretch, headless torso, boatish silhouette, light textures). I like the overall effect as well. Great picture! Great title too, as such, but I fail to make the connection... (Sorry, I''m not allowed to vote, so I can''t boost your average.)', '2008-05-30 14:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734760, 681372, 93765, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and textures. I find the fenders disturbing, and I''m not sure that the pier adds anything more than the confirmation that this is probably a vessel. I would probably have cropped from the right until the fenders were gone (and ended up with a pretty abstract picture and lots of DNMC''s, no doubt...)</td>', 'Nice colours and textures. I find the fenders disturbing, and I''m not sure that the pier adds anything more than the confirmation that this is probably a vessel. I would probably have cropped from the right until the fenders were gone (and ended up with a pretty abstract picture and lots of DNMC''s, no doubt...)', '2008-05-30 14:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734768, 681998, 93765, '<td valign="top">I''m getting tuned in to these "very little future, a lot of past"-crops for oldtimers now, several of them in this contest.  But I still find it unnerving. Which probably is a good thing, since I have to stop and really deal with the picture, rather than just tick it off as smooth eye candy. I wouldn''t mind a bit more sepia in this one. Perhaps some grain as well.</td>', 'I''m getting tuned in to these "very little future, a lot of past"-crops for oldtimers now, several of them in this contest.  But I still find it unnerving. Which probably is a good thing, since I have to stop and really deal with the picture, rather than just tick it off as smooth eye candy. I wouldn''t mind a bit more sepia in this one. Perhaps some grain as well.', '2008-05-30 15:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734773, 682189, 77724, '<td valign="top">Simple composition - very nice - well done on the reflection</td>', 'Simple composition - very nice - well done on the reflection', '2008-05-30 15:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734775, 681248, 93765, '<td valign="top">This has got quite an oldish feel to it. The faded frame is a nice touch. The "oldtimer crop" (little future, lots of past) forces me to stop and think. All in all nicely balanced. A bit of grain might have enhanced the feel further.</td>', 'This has got quite an oldish feel to it. The faded frame is a nice touch. The "oldtimer crop" (little future, lots of past) forces me to stop and think. All in all nicely balanced. A bit of grain might have enhanced the feel further.', '2008-05-30 15:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734776, 682191, 77724, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines.</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines.', '2008-05-30 15:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734779, 682017, 77724, '<td valign="top">Well executed night exposure, composition a little busy for me.</td>', 'Well executed night exposure, composition a little busy for me.', '2008-05-30 15:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734780, 681410, 77724, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what you did, but the more I look at it the more I like it.</td>', 'I don''t know what you did, but the more I look at it the more I like it.', '2008-05-30 15:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734781, 681638, 77724, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, well captured, good color.</td>', 'Nice scene, well captured, good color.', '2008-05-30 15:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734784, 681423, 77724, '<td valign="top">Great find - nice B&amp;W very clear.</td>', 'Great find - nice B&W very clear.', '2008-05-30 15:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734786, 681807, 77724, '<td valign="top">Another #92, interesting.  Ncie use of DOF.  I like how the water fades at the top.</td>', 'Another #92, interesting.  Ncie use of DOF.  I like how the water fades at the top.', '2008-05-30 15:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734788, 681996, 77724, '<td valign="top">Great abstract of lines &amp; their curved reflections.</td>', 'Great abstract of lines & their curved reflections.', '2008-05-30 15:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734798, 681140, 93765, '<td valign="top">Landlocked, are we...? Spur of a moment, last-minute entry?<br/>What if you had tried to get a bit of a "panning effect" to emphasize the speed element. That way you could perhaps have increased the DOF a bit, and blurred the "wake" in the "speed stripes" instead. And gotten a "speedy" "water surface". That yellow brick at the bottom would have to go (unless of course the wheel is attached to it. Hmm). A bit of blue tack or clay instead, to get the bow to lift, perhaps? Or a bit of "spray" around the bow to hide the yellow brick?</td>', 'Landlocked, are we...? Spur of a moment, last-minute entry?What if you had tried to get a bit of a "panning effect" to emphasize the speed element. That way you could perhaps have increased the DOF a bit, and blurred the "wake" in the "speed stripes" instead. And gotten a "speedy" "water surface". That yellow brick at the bottom would have to go (unless of course the wheel is attached to it. Hmm). A bit of blue tack or clay instead, to get the bow to lift, perhaps? Or a bit of "spray" around the bow to hide the yellow brick?', '2008-05-30 15:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734823, 682030, 93765, '<td valign="top">That sky disturbs me, it is just about too "perfect". If it really was there, congratulations on catching a lucky moment and bringing it out like this. If you put it there, congratulations for an inspired eye. The colour scheme is great and supports a suitable message. The hulk is a sorry sight indeed, as are all abandoned boats. But who thought it necessary to add insult to injury by putting the poor thing in a cage, and why?</td>', 'That sky disturbs me, it is just about too "perfect". If it really was there, congratulations on catching a lucky moment and bringing it out like this. If you put it there, congratulations for an inspired eye. The colour scheme is great and supports a suitable message. The hulk is a sorry sight indeed, as are all abandoned boats. But who thought it necessary to add insult to injury by putting the poor thing in a cage, and why?', '2008-05-30 16:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734842, 682075, 93765, '<td valign="top">The texture of the wood and the nails really pop at you. The colour play between the flaking varnish and the graying wood is great. The sky is interesting. Lighting and focus are fine. And yet I''m not sure that I like the picture. The perspective belittles the strong and mighty bow, to the point of reducing it to a mere appendix. Thinking aloud here - this could have been a great perspective for the authorities of the threatened central European cities, to encourage their citizens when the Vikings approached up the river...</td>', 'The texture of the wood and the nails really pop at you. The colour play between the flaking varnish and the graying wood is great. The sky is interesting. Lighting and focus are fine. And yet I''m not sure that I like the picture. The perspective belittles the strong and mighty bow, to the point of reducing it to a mere appendix. Thinking aloud here - this could have been a great perspective for the authorities of the threatened central European cities, to encourage their citizens when the Vikings approached up the river...', '2008-05-30 16:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734854, 681976, 93765, '<td valign="top">That fill flash / reflector is almost a bit much, giving it a surreal quality. Bur OTOH, how else could you have brought out all those wonderful textures and colours, that really make the picture? I feel mesmerized. Thumbs up!</td>', 'That fill flash / reflector is almost a bit much, giving it a surreal quality. Bur OTOH, how else could you have brought out all those wonderful textures and colours, that really make the picture? I feel mesmerized. Thumbs up!', '2008-05-30 16:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734865, 681223, 93765, '<td valign="top">Great sky, fantastic colours. That silver streak along the horizon is the final touch. The ferry is just an alibi for the challenge, right...;) Just joking, it is an essential element, balancing it all.</td>', 'Great sky, fantastic colours. That silver streak along the horizon is the final touch. The ferry is just an alibi for the challenge, right...;) Just joking, it is an essential element, balancing it all.', '2008-05-30 16:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734874, 681511, 93765, '<td valign="top">En garde? Those sticky bits really bring this one in. Just spent an inordinate time wondering if I should like the subdued colours. Decided I probably should. Cool shot.</td>', 'En garde? Those sticky bits really bring this one in. Just spent an inordinate time wondering if I should like the subdued colours. Decided I probably should. Cool shot.', '2008-05-30 16:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734880, 681503, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s like I''ve seen this photo hanging in a building someplace. So, it must be good: 10</td>', 'It''s like I''ve seen this photo hanging in a building someplace. So, it must be good: 10', '2008-05-30 16:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734881, 681812, 62187, '<td valign="top">...and inside out! Weird...8</td>', '...and inside out! Weird...8', '2008-05-30 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734883, 681714, 62187, '<td valign="top">The composition and crop are perfect. To me, not that it''s out of focus but seems like it could be a little sharper. 8</td>', 'The composition and crop are perfect. To me, not that it''s out of focus but seems like it could be a little sharper. 8', '2008-05-30 16:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734885, 680417, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective and edit. I like it: 9</td>', 'Very nice perspective and edit. I like it: 9', '2008-05-30 17:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734890, 682044, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, the sky looks a little pixelated which could just be my monitor. I really like your photo, the reflection is great and doesn''t overpower the boat. 9</td>', 'To me, the sky looks a little pixelated which could just be my monitor. I really like your photo, the reflection is great and doesn''t overpower the boat. 9', '2008-05-30 17:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734892, 681885, 62187, '<td valign="top">I hope the border is legal because I''m giving your photo a 10, I think it''s perfect and in my book, certainly a contender for a ribbon.</td>', 'I hope the border is legal because I''m giving your photo a 10, I think it''s perfect and in my book, certainly a contender for a ribbon.', '2008-05-30 17:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734893, 682026, 62187, '<td valign="top">Compared to the background and reflection in the water, the boats are boring and almost like they''re not a major part of the photo. But, it''s a super great photo I think deserves a 10.</td>', 'Compared to the background and reflection in the water, the boats are boring and almost like they''re not a major part of the photo. But, it''s a super great photo I think deserves a 10.', '2008-05-30 17:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734895, 681620, 62187, '<td valign="top">2+4 is only 6 and 2x4 is only 8 neither of which are high enough scores for your photo. 10 sounds good to me.</td>', '2+4 is only 6 and 2x4 is only 8 neither of which are high enough scores for your photo. 10 sounds good to me.', '2008-05-30 17:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734900, 681736, 62187, '<td valign="top">Your edit works for me. Seems a little dark but I suspect that was so the smoke would show up better. Very good composition: 10</td>', 'Your edit works for me. Seems a little dark but I suspect that was so the smoke would show up better. Very good composition: 10', '2008-05-30 17:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734903, 682187, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s nothing to do with the photo, but: why would anybody do this without wearing a life jacket and I''m sure the dog is having the time of his life but I''ll bet he can''t swim all the way to the shore. Unless it''s maybe where you''re standing. Anyway...the color in your photo and focus are very nice. The horizon seems a touch tilted or rather the buildings not vertical.</td>', 'It''s nothing to do with the photo, but: why would anybody do this without wearing a life jacket and I''m sure the dog is having the time of his life but I''ll bet he can''t swim all the way to the shore. Unless it''s maybe where you''re standing. Anyway...the color in your photo and focus are very nice. The horizon seems a touch tilted or rather the buildings not vertical.', '2008-05-30 17:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734904, 682125, 93765, '<td valign="top">The sore thumb of the challenge, no doubt. Great idea, nicely set up, fine lighting, in harmony with the title. Why not? But the moon is a very pale blue...;)</td>', 'The sore thumb of the challenge, no doubt. Great idea, nicely set up, fine lighting, in harmony with the title. Why not? But the moon is a very pale blue...;)', '2008-05-30 17:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734910, 682125, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s such a sad tale...I can''t give your photo a 10 but I can do almost as good...9</td>', 'It''s such a sad tale...I can''t give your photo a 10 but I can do almost as good...9', '2008-05-30 17:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734914, 682098, 93765, '<td valign="top">I went from "boring" to "hey, this really has something" in a matter of seconds. I guess you will have given the surroundings of the house a bit of an "enlightening", which gives that little edge. The house looks positively inviting compared with the harsh surroundings. The ice of course elevates it further from the masses. This is definitely an "I like it" picture!</td>', 'I went from "boring" to "hey, this really has something" in a matter of seconds. I guess you will have given the surroundings of the house a bit of an "enlightening", which gives that little edge. The house looks positively inviting compared with the harsh surroundings. The ice of course elevates it further from the masses. This is definitely an "I like it" picture!', '2008-05-30 17:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734919, 681812, 93765, '<td valign="top">Tricky! I''ve been looking at it for quite a while now, and I think/guess/hope I know how you got there. Great idea, great colours, and - if you are so inclined - a picture that is impossible to pass with just a casual glance.</td>', 'Tricky! I''ve been looking at it for quite a while now, and I think/guess/hope I know how you got there. Great idea, great colours, and - if you are so inclined - a picture that is impossible to pass with just a casual glance.', '2008-05-30 17:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734921, 681962, 62187, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect! ...except for that orange (piece of trash?) in the water. Oh yeck...it adds color. I think your photo is a contender for a ribbon. 10</td>', 'Absolutely perfect! ...except for that orange (piece of trash?) in the water. Oh yeck...it adds color. I think your photo is a contender for a ribbon. 10', '2008-05-30 17:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734923, 681996, 62187, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo but for the challenge and in all fairness to the other photos, it''s just too far out of the box even for me.</td>', 'I really like the photo but for the challenge and in all fairness to the other photos, it''s just too far out of the box even for me.', '2008-05-30 17:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
