(4734929, 681952, 62187, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit blurry to me or maybe could be sharper or...it could be my monitor I guess. The colors are awesome.</td>', 'It seems a bit blurry to me or maybe could be sharper or...it could be my monitor I guess. The colors are awesome.', '2008-05-30 17:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734931, 681406, 93765, '<td valign="top">Just the illustration for tranquility. The softness of the bow is slightly irritating, otherwise perfect.</td>', 'Just the illustration for tranquility. The softness of the bow is slightly irritating, otherwise perfect.', '2008-05-30 17:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734932, 681906, 62187, '<td valign="top">Three points for each Tug: 9</td>', 'Three points for each Tug: 9', '2008-05-30 17:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734937, 681160, 62187, '<td valign="top">What, are you crazy? Boats don''t grow in the desert! You should get to the hospital and see a Doctor! (My son really liked your photo - he knows where you took it. Me, I don''t venture to far from downtown.) I think if you would have brightened the photo a little, it would have brought out the nice yellow colors better making for a higher scored photo. The overall composition and idea of the photo are great!</td>', 'What, are you crazy? Boats don''t grow in the desert! You should get to the hospital and see a Doctor! (My son really liked your photo - he knows where you took it. Me, I don''t venture to far from downtown.) I think if you would have brightened the photo a little, it would have brought out the nice yellow colors better making for a higher scored photo. The overall composition and idea of the photo are great!', '2008-05-30 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734945, 682192, 62187, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful looking place and a very nice photo of it. The conversion works but living in the desert I hardly ever get to see water and am wondering what the original would look like. For the challenge, I''ll score your photo at 9. I think the focus on the rower could be just a tad bit sharper.</td>', 'What a wonderful looking place and a very nice photo of it. The conversion works but living in the desert I hardly ever get to see water and am wondering what the original would look like. For the challenge, I''ll score your photo at 9. I think the focus on the rower could be just a tad bit sharper.', '2008-05-30 17:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734947, 682131, 62187, '<td valign="top">With the price of fuel these days I''ll take the sail boat. Very nice photo: 9</td>', 'With the price of fuel these days I''ll take the sail boat. Very nice photo: 9', '2008-05-30 17:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734949, 680637, 62187, '<td valign="top">For me, the overall photo is great. But, something is not perfect and it may be my monitor (???). The photo seems oversharpened in some areas and not sharpened enough in others. I really like the border and soft, earthy tones.</td>', 'For me, the overall photo is great. But, something is not perfect and it may be my monitor (???). The photo seems oversharpened in some areas and not sharpened enough in others. I really like the border and soft, earthy tones.', '2008-05-30 17:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734950, 681733, 62187, '<td valign="top">Pretty good...I like it...8</td>', 'Pretty good...I like it...8', '2008-05-30 17:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734954, 681604, 62187, '<td valign="top">Really? Is it toys? Like a Diorama? Really? No...oh well...I kinda like it...very 3-D looking.</td>', 'Really? Is it toys? Like a Diorama? Really? No...oh well...I kinda like it...very 3-D looking.', '2008-05-30 17:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734955, 681167, 62187, '<td valign="top">Three points for each boat: 9</td>', 'Three points for each boat: 9', '2008-05-30 17:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734960, 681162, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a clever photo and title and not a bad photo by any means. I think a more interesting shot would have been to focus more on that big boat and forget about the bird. But, that''s just me.</td>', 'It''s a clever photo and title and not a bad photo by any means. I think a more interesting shot would have been to focus more on that big boat and forget about the bird. But, that''s just me.', '2008-05-30 18:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734961, 681984, 93765, '<td valign="top">The TN looked just up my alley, but the picture didn''t quite meet my expectations. I think I can see where you were going, and I''d have been with you there, but in my view we are not quite there yet. The brown/sepia bits all over the place, especially the remains of the waves, and the bits to the left and possibly to the right of the island, would have to go. They have too much of a photo to qualify for what would be a pretty great minimalistic, almost abstract study. I would probably have cropped it considerably from the bottom as well, to bring the island down below the center of the picture. But then again, you may have been going someplace else, and that is fair enough...;)</td>', 'The TN looked just up my alley, but the picture didn''t quite meet my expectations. I think I can see where you were going, and I''d have been with you there, but in my view we are not quite there yet. The brown/sepia bits all over the place, especially the remains of the waves, and the bits to the left and possibly to the right of the island, would have to go. They have too much of a photo to qualify for what would be a pretty great minimalistic, almost abstract study. I would probably have cropped it considerably from the bottom as well, to bring the island down below the center of the picture. But then again, you may have been going someplace else, and that is fair enough...;)', '2008-05-30 18:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734963, 681406, 62187, '<td valign="top">Uh oh...I think we have a winner. If this is not a ribbon winner I don''t know what is. It''s a shame the title was most likely misspelled because now it will never be able to be corrected and I think some people might vote your photo down because of the misspelling. I''m sticking with a 10 though.</td>', 'Uh oh...I think we have a winner. If this is not a ribbon winner I don''t know what is. It''s a shame the title was most likely misspelled because now it will never be able to be corrected and I think some people might vote your photo down because of the misspelling. I''m sticking with a 10 though.', '2008-05-30 18:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734966, 681967, 62187, '<td valign="top">What I think could have been a perfect photo has been, to me anyway, over processed. It''s mostly the jagginess on the far side of the boats.</td>', 'What I think could have been a perfect photo has been, to me anyway, over processed. It''s mostly the jagginess on the far side of the boats.', '2008-05-30 18:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734967, 682094, 62187, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo that looks like an oil painting but just too hard to see a boat (for me anyway).</td>', 'A lovely photo that looks like an oil painting but just too hard to see a boat (for me anyway).', '2008-05-30 18:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
