(4734977, 681962, 93765, '<td valign="top">The painting-like quality is quite appealing, but you should have fished out that floating plastic bag and removed that bit of red waste near the shrubs before the shot. In this type of a romantic picture you do not want to be reminded of the harsh reality...<br/>Looks like a great place, btw.</td>', 'The painting-like quality is quite appealing, but you should have fished out that floating plastic bag and removed that bit of red waste near the shrubs before the shot. In this type of a romantic picture you do not want to be reminded of the harsh reality...Looks like a great place, btw.', '2008-05-30 18:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734979, 681976, 62187, '<td valign="top">I originally scored your photo at 9. On second look I can''t find any reason why I wouldn''t give it a 10. So, 10 it is.</td>', 'I originally scored your photo at 9. On second look I can''t find any reason why I wouldn''t give it a 10. So, 10 it is.', '2008-05-30 18:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734985, 681423, 62187, '<td valign="top">I wanted to score your photo at 10 but there seems to be just a tad to much sharpening at the starboard bow. As it goes, I''ll go with the next best thing: 9. So, I did some research and found out that this boat, the Magus, washed ashore on May 24 onto Buddina Beach in Australia.</td>', 'I wanted to score your photo at 10 but there seems to be just a tad to much sharpening at the starboard bow. As it goes, I''ll go with the next best thing: 9. So, I did some research and found out that this boat, the Magus, washed ashore on May 24 onto Buddina Beach in Australia.', '2008-05-30 18:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4734988, 682185, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why this photo makes me feel like I''m spying on those people but it does. It''s kinda creepy truth be told. But, the photo is good and they look happy.</td>', 'I don''t know why this photo makes me feel like I''m spying on those people but it does. It''s kinda creepy truth be told. But, the photo is good and they look happy.', '2008-05-30 18:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
