(4734991, 681546, 62187, '<td valign="top">Some strangeness with the edit going on around the sun but really nice in the water. I''ll go with a respectable 8</td>', 'Some strangeness with the edit going on around the sun but really nice in the water. I''ll go with a respectable 8', '2008-05-30 18:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
