(4734997, 682097, 62187, '<td valign="top">My original score was 8 only because some of the other ''Boat'' photos were very, very good with super nice backdrops and stuff. But now, at second look, I see nothing in your photo that should prevent it from being a 10. So, there you have it: 10.</td>', 'My original score was 8 only because some of the other ''Boat'' photos were very, very good with super nice backdrops and stuff. But now, at second look, I see nothing in your photo that should prevent it from being a 10. So, there you have it: 10.', '2008-05-30 18:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
