(4735694, 682013, 77724, '<td valign="top">Impressive clarity on the boat considering the movement of the clouds, Love the low angle on the boat but not sure centered is the best way to go here - I would like to see it to one side of the other.  Don''t get me wrong, I like this a lot - please post your outtakes when the challenge is over, I would love to see more.</td>', 'Impressive clarity on the boat considering the movement of the clouds, Love the low angle on the boat but not sure centered is the best way to go here - I would like to see it to one side of the other.  Don''t get me wrong, I like this a lot - please post your outtakes when the challenge is over, I would love to see more.', '2008-05-31 02:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735695, 681400, 77724, '<td valign="top">Spot on exposure, amazinging large DOF - everthing is clear</td>', 'Spot on exposure, amazinging large DOF - everthing is clear', '2008-05-31 02:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4735696, 681546, 77724, '<td valign="top">Awsome sky!</td>', 'Awsome sky!', '2008-05-31 02:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
