(4735698, 681816, 77724, '<td valign="top">Nailed the exposure,  love the colors and the waethered textures of the boats.  I hope this doesn''t get over looked I like it a lot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nailed the exposure,  love the colors and the waethered textures of the boats.  I hope this doesn''t get over looked I like it a lot.  Good luck.', '2008-05-31 02:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
