(4735744, 682189, 76430, '<td valign="top">Lovely perfect mirror reflection on the boat.  I was going to submit a picture titled "The" from a marking on the back of a boat for this one, but did another instead.  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=683956" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76430/120/683956.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76430/120/683956.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76430/120/683956.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Lovely perfect mirror reflection on the boat.  I was going to submit a picture titled "The" from a marking on the back of a boat for this one, but did another instead.  ', '2008-05-31 02:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
