(4742059, 681996, 811, '<td valign="top">I really, really like the abstract nature of this and the simple colors.  I thought it was very well done.  Even though I have been here at dpc over 6 years, I am astounded at how people want to be hit over the head with pictures.  This, to me, is very obviously a boat.  Or maybe I''m just out there.  Anyway, I thought it was an excellent shot.  Best to you in future challenges.</td>', 'I really, really like the abstract nature of this and the simple colors.  I thought it was very well done.  Even though I have been here at dpc over 6 years, I am astounded at how people want to be hit over the head with pictures.  This, to me, is very obviously a boat.  Or maybe I''m just out there.  Anyway, I thought it was an excellent shot.  Best to you in future challenges.', '2008-06-02 13:48:06.000000', NULL, 0),
