(4742796, 681733, 93883, '<td valign="top">Wow this one was waaaaaay underrated, it was one of my very favorites in the challenge.  You took everything into account, the lighting, the subject, the angles, the composition, and managed to create a very distinct mood out of it.  Seriously it made me shiver when I first saw it.  It''s very different from everything else that was entered.  And although I figured it was a model boat because of the control over the lighting and the angle that you took it from, it could just as easily have been a scene from the Pirates of the Caribbean or something.  You got a 10 from me and I''m faving it :) (haha, I guess I get a little defensive of my favorites)<br/> <br/>also-I love that your dad made it, and happy belated birthday!</td>', 'Wow this one was waaaaaay underrated, it was one of my very favorites in the challenge.  You took everything into account, the lighting, the subject, the angles, the composition, and managed to create a very distinct mood out of it.  Seriously it made me shiver when I first saw it.  It''s very different from everything else that was entered.  And although I figured it was a model boat because of the control over the lighting and the angle that you took it from, it could just as easily have been a scene from the Pirates of the Caribbean or something.  You got a 10 from me and I''m faving it :) (haha, I guess I get a little defensive of my favorites) also-I love that your dad made it, and happy belated birthday!', '2008-06-02 17:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4742849, 681996, 93883, '<td valign="top">Somehow my comment during the challenge didn''t go through on this one.  I think this is an excellent abstract because the lines and colors keep your eyes moving through it and create interest.  The balance of the picture works well and although I usually don''t care for many abstracts, I find one really nice.</td>', 'Somehow my comment during the challenge didn''t go through on this one.  I think this is an excellent abstract because the lines and colors keep your eyes moving through it and create interest.  The balance of the picture works well and although I usually don''t care for many abstracts, I find one really nice.', '2008-06-02 18:16:46.000000', NULL, 0),
