(4743584, 681423, 90495, '<td valign="top">I really liked this image when first viewed, that''s why I gave it an 8. It''s a wonderful view and sight. It''s always baffled me to see these ships get washed ashore like that. Living inland doesn''t give me much of a chance to see these events. Call me next time. ;\<br/> <br/>Congrats on your PB and top 10!</td>', 'I really liked this image when first viewed, that''s why I gave it an 8. It''s a wonderful view and sight. It''s always baffled me to see these ships get washed ashore like that. Living inland doesn''t give me much of a chance to see these events. Call me next time. ;\ Congrats on your PB and top 10!', '2008-06-02 23:04:19.000000', NULL, 0),
