(4744116, 681812, 22301, '<td valign="top">I thought this was one of the most creative/interesting shots in the challenge. I hoped it would finish much better than it did.</td>', 'I thought this was one of the most creative/interesting shots in the challenge. I hoped it would finish much better than it did.', '2008-06-03 01:29:48.000000', NULL, 0),
