(4744736, 681604, 39164, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. This effect was achieved in Photoshop using gradient masks and the Lens Blur filter. These are full-sized boats.<br/> <br/>The actual photo was taken on the Amstel river in Amsterdam, and yes, those are lock in the background.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. This effect was achieved in Photoshop using gradient masks and the Lens Blur filter. These are full-sized boats. The actual photo was taken on the Amstel river in Amsterdam, and yes, those are lock in the background.', '2008-06-03 10:16:19.000000', NULL, 0);
