(4748489, 681967, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rcpr:</b></div><hr/><i> stunning... but curious as to how they get to the boats...;)<br/> <br/>i was saddened by the loss of your friend...<br/> <br/>randy </i></td></tr></table> <br/>A big guy in a wetsuit wades into the lake every morning to get the boats then he takes them back at night. The water is pretty deep and goes up to his chest, so it''s an interesting sight to see ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by rcpr: stunning... but curious as to how they get to the boats...;) i was saddened by the loss of your friend... randy  A big guy in a wetsuit wades into the lake every morning to get the boats then he takes them back at night. The water is pretty deep and goes up to his chest, so it''s an interesting sight to see ;-)', '2008-06-04 12:39:36.000000', NULL, 0),
